#: image_region_transform/_ui.py:132
msgid "How much hard pixel edges are smoothed when the transform rotates, shears or warps: 0% keeps the hardest possible edges (a staircase may show on rotated hard edges), 100% gives smooth antialiased edges. Applies to the final result and the preview; plain moves are never softened"
msgstr "变换旋转、剪切或扭曲时硬像素边缘的平滑程度：0% 保持最硬的边缘（旋转的硬边缘可能出现锯齿），100% 得到平滑的抗锯齿边缘。应用于最终结果和预览；纯移动永不柔化"

#: image_region_transform/_ui.py:312
