#: image_region_transform/_ui.py:116
msgid "Interpolation used when applying transforms and for the live preview. Catmull-Rom: bicubic, balanced. Lanczos-3: windowed sinc, sharpest, slight ripple on hard edges. Mitchell-Netravali: softest, least ringing, but NOT pixel-exact — even a plain move blurs ~11% (the filter is approximating). A pure integer move is pixel-exact with Catmull-Rom and Lanczos-3"
msgstr "应用变换和实时预览时使用的插值。Catmull-Rom：双三次，均衡。Lanczos-3：加窗 sinc，最锐利，硬边缘有轻微波纹。Mitchell-Netravali：最柔和，振铃最少，但非像素精确 — 即使纯移动也会模糊约 11%（滤波器为近似）。纯整数移动在 Catmull-Rom 和 Lanczos-3 下像素精确"

